  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_NAME_13
    value: <style=title><size=34>FREE SPIN SYMBOL</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_14
    value: <size=20>3 or more Quick Change Symbols anywhere on reels triggers Quick
      Change Bonus.
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_14_VALUE
    value: '<b><size=24>5 <style=coinColor>up to 150 x Total Bet</style>

      4 <style=coinColor>up to 50 x Total Bet</style>

      3 <style=coinColor>up to 20 x Total Bet</style></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_13
    value: <size=20>3 or more Free Spin Symbols anywhere on reels triggers Free Spins.
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_13_VALUE
    value: '<b><size=24>5 <style=coinColor>awards 20 Free Spins</style>

      4 <style=coinColor>awards 10 Free Spins</style>

      3 <style=coinColor>awards 5 Free Spins</style></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_PAYOUT_FORMAT
    value: '<b><size=24>5 <style=coinColor>{2:CommaNumber}</style>

      4 <style=coinColor>{1:CommaNumber}</style>

      3 <style=coinColor>{0:CommaNumber}</style></size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_PAYOUT_FORMAT_WILD
    value: '<b><size=24>5 <style=coinColor>{3:CommaNumber}</style>

      4 <style=coinColor>{2:CommaNumber}</style>

      3 <style=coinColor>{1:CommaNumber}</style>

      2 <style=coinColor>{0:CommaNumber}</style></size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_3
    value: <style=title><size=42>BONUS GAME</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_WILD_EXPAND
    value: <style=title><size=42>EXPANDING WILD</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_FREE_GAMES
    value: <style=title><size=42>FREE SPINS</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_XRAY
    value: <style=title><size=42>X-RAY BONUS</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_QUICK_CHANGE
    value: <style=title><size=42>QUICK CHANGE BONUS</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_QUICK_JACKPOT
    value: <style=title><size=42>GRAND & MEGA JACKPOTS</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_WILD_EXPAND
    value: <size=20>Ken Kash expands over the reel with a dazzling transformation
      into Multiplier Man when a Wild lands anywhere on reels 2 and 4.<br><br>Wild
      substitutes for all symbols except Free Spin Symbol and Quick Change Symbol.
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_FREE_GAMES
    value: <size=24>Free Spins are initiated by receiving 3 or Free Spin symbols on
      the reels.<br>The number of Free Spins awarded depends on the number of Free
      Spin symbols received.<br><br>During Free Spins, any portion of Multiplier Man
      that appears on the reels will nudge up or down resulting in Stacked Wilds.<br><br>Quick
      Change Bonus and X-Ray Bonus can both be triggered within Free Spins and more
      Free Spins can be re-initiated within the round.
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_XRAY
    value: <size=24>The X-Ray Bonus is a random on-screen bonus event which has Multiplier
      Man scanning a selected safe for Multiplier prize.<br><br>The event can be triggered
      during Base Games and Free Spins.<br><br>Pays up to 12x Total Bet.
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_QUICK_CHANGE
    value: <size=22>Quick Change Bonus is initiated by receiving 3 or more Quick Change
      Symbols on reels.<br><br>Awards depend on the number of triggering Quick Change
      Symbols.<br><br>In this Bonus, there are 3 challenging levels players must pass
      to increase their award by guessing if the next cards are higher or lower than
      the current one.<br><br>Each card is drawn from a new deck of 52 cards.<br><br>Ties
      are counted as wins.<br><br>All wins are multiplied by Total Bet.
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_JACKPOT
    value: <size=22>- Each spin provides the user an opportunity to win the Jackpot.<br>-
      After each spin, either a GRAND or MEGA JACKPOT may be awarded.
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_3_1
    value: '<size=16>TO BEGIN. SIMPLY CLICK THE

      "PICK ME" BUTTON NEXT TO ONE

      OF THE DETONATORS TO REVEAL

      THE NUMBER OF SPECULATIVE

      EXPLOSIONS AWARDED.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_3_2
    value: '<size=16>THERE ARE 5 RANDOMLY

      HIDDEN OIL PUMP INSTALLATIONS

      ON THE GRID. STRIKING OIL WILL

      REVEAL THE LOCATION OF THE

      OIL PUMP.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_3_3
    value: '<size=16>A PROGRESSIVE JACKPOT IS

      WON WHEN AN OIL INSTALLATION

      IS FULLY REVEALED DURING THE

      BONUS GAME. CREDITS ARE ALSO

      WON FOR INDIVIDUAL STRIKES

      TO THE OIL PUMPS.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_LINES
    value: <style=title><size=42>LINES</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_WAY_INFO
    value: <size=24><color=#00eaff>20 LINES</color></size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_BET_INFO
    value: '<size=24><color=#00eaff>Bet Per Line: 1</color></size>'
  - key: CONTENTS_GAME_TITLE
    value: Multiplier Man
  - key: PUMPJACK_JACKPOT_CREDIT
    value: '{0:SimpleNumber}'
